    MC @ talk "仕方がない。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:296
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_7954271c:

    # MC @ talk "Each of the places are called 'districts,' and they all serve different purposes."
    MC @ talk "それぞれの場所は「地区」と呼ばれ、それぞれ異なる目的を果たしている。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:297
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_697157e2:

    # MYU "Are the other districts nicer than this one?"
    MYU "他の地区はこっちよりいいのかな？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:298
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_b755bb64:

    # MC @ talk "Of course, much nicer."
    MC @ talk "もちろん、ずっといい。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:299
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_092e4223_1:

    # MYU "...Why?"
    MYU "……なぜ？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:300
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_5a4637c8:

    # MYU "Are the people here... {i}not needed?{/i}"
    MYU "ここの人たちは…{i}必要とされていない？{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:301
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_82fc95a5:

    # MC @ smile "The people here are the most important, they keep everything going."
    MC @ smile "ここにいる人々は何より大切で、すべてを支えている。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:302
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_a03f9770:

    # MYU "...Then why do they not live in the nice districts?"
    MYU "…では、なぜ彼らは良い地区に住まないのですか？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:303
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_0e744dc8:

    # MC @ sad "It's... complicated."
    MC @ sad "複雑な事情だな…"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:304
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_4fd8abf7:

    # MC @ sad "Things are harder now because of the war."
    MC @ sad "今は戦争のせいで物事が大変だ。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:305
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_cd8d44d9:

    # MC @ talk "Hopefully after the war, people will go back to living much better lives like they used to before."
    MC @ talk "願わくは、戦後、人々が以前のように良い生活に戻れますように。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:306
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_d81b8530:

    # MYU "Do the rich people live harder lives as well?"
    MYU "金持ちの人たちも、同じように苦労しているのでしょうか？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:307
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_d37ab87f:

    # MC @ think "Well, not exactly."
    MC @ think "まあ、正確には違うな。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:308
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_092e4223_2:

    # MYU "...Why?"
    MYU "なぜ…。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:309
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_0e70507b:

    # MC @ talk "It depends on the person, Myu."
    MC @ talk "人それぞれだよ、ミュ。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:310
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_a8c013cf:

    # MC @ talk "Even if they have suffered because of the war, many still have enough wealth to get by comfortably."
    MC @ talk "戦争の影響を受けていても、不自由なく暮らせるだけの財産は残っている人が多い。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:311
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_27ce3319:

    # MC @ talk "Let's move on now."
    MC @ talk "では、先に進みましょう。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:312
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_6060f786:

    # MC @ talk "There's much more to see."
    MC @ talk "見るべきものは、まだまだたくさんある。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:320
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_a636ce6d:

    # MC @ talk "There is where students come to learn how to use their magic."
    MC @ talk "学生たちが魔法の使い方を学びに訪れる場所です。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:321
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_05fa9bc8:

    # MYU "Do you have magic?"
    MYU "魔法は使えますか？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:322
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_4800c544:

    # MC @ talk "No, I failed every test on it."
    MC @ talk "いや、全部失敗した。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:324
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_39c86d5f:

    # MC @ talk "Or, you get stuck with the regular schooling like the rest of us."
    MC @ talk "それとも、私たちみたいに普通の学校に通うしかなくなるのよ。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:325
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_3235e42a:

    # MYU "...Is Myu magic?"
    MYU "…ミュは魔法なの？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:326
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_c8bb141f:

    # MC @ think "You're a being of magical descent, so you likely have {i}some{/i} magic."
    MC @ think "あなたは魔法の血筋を引いているのだから、{i}何らかの{/i}魔力はあるだろう。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:327
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_bfd4899f:

    # MYU "Hrghhhhh!"
    MYU "ぐぐぅ…!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:328
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_60ccbb87:

    # MC @ surprised "What are you doing?"
    MC @ surprised "何をしているの？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:329
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_9209d41d:

    # MYU "Trying to magic! I wanna see if I can make bacon appear!"
    MYU "魔法を試そう!ベーコンを出現させられるか見たいの!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:330
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_75426a97:

    # MC @ smile2 "It doesn't quite work like that."
    MC @ smile2 "そう単純にはいかない。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:331
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_b0674f86:

    # MYU "Aww..."
    MYU "あぁ…"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:332
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_d3335976:

    # MC @ talk "There's a lot of rules to magic, all of which, I don't even fully understand myself."
    MC @ talk "魔法には様々なルールがあるが、
そのすべてを、私自身すら完全には理解していない。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:333
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_0dc3a2f7:

    # MC @ talk "Anyway, let's keep moving, shall we?"
    MC @ talk "とにかく、先に進みましょうか。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:341
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_89b56d18:

    # MC @ talk "There is where farmers work and live."
    MC @ talk "農民が働き、生活する場所だ。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:342
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_6ff4798e:

    # MC @ talk "Huge fields of land inside these walls are used for farming so that Novaras can sustain itself in the event of a siege."
    MC @ talk "これらの城壁内にある広大な土地は農耕に利用され、ノヴァラスが包囲されても自立できるようにしている。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:343
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_f47ac91e:

    # MYU "Siege?"
    MYU "包囲？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:344
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_fccbf799:

    # MC @ serious "If the Demorai tries to take this place, we could hold out for months, hopefully waiting on reinforcements from the North."
    MC @ serious "デモライがここを奪おうとするなら、我々は数ヶ月は持ちこたえられる、北からの増援を待ち受けるかたちで。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:345
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_a450f072:

    # MYU "Ooooooh."
    MYU "おおおおお。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:346
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_bb20e0aa:

    # MYU "So, can we get food here?"
    MYU "で、ここで食事はできる？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:347
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_c02730c7:

    # MYU "Myu, hungry."
    MYU "Myu、お腹すいた。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:348
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_a640ddce:

    # MC @ talk "No, the food here is rationed out to the army and districts."
    MC @ talk "いいえ、ここの食料は軍隊と地区に配給されています。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:349
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_10d1c41a:

    # MC @ talk "Everyone is given a bit of food, some more than others depending on their district."
    MC @ talk "それぞれが少しの食料を与えられるが、それがどの地区かによっては多めの人もいる。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:350
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_9eee31e8:

    # MC @ talk "But you can buy additional food from what they allocate to the merchants to sell."
    MC @ talk "しかし、商人に割り当てられた販売分から追加の食料を購入することはできます。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:351
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_45ea512f:

    # MYU "Why..."
    MYU "なぜ…"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:352
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_06a8db09:

    # "Myu puzzled out her thoughts."
    "ミュは考えを整理した。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:353
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_95c66aed:

    # MYU "Some get more than others?"
    MYU "多い者も少ない者もいる？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:354
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_4c622349:

    # MYU "If they are rich, Why they not just buy more food anyway?"
    MYU "もしお金持ちなら、どうしてもっと食べ物を買えばいいの？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:355
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_07a7a739:

    # MYU "Then more food... For poor."
    MYU "それからもっと食べ物…貧しい人たちに。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:356
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_2ca9bbe8:

    # MC @ think "Well, yes..."
    MC @ think "ええ、そうです…"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:357
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_3b20968d:

    # MC @ smile "I guess no one's ever really thought about it much."
    MC @ smile "誰も深く考えたことないんじゃないかな。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:358
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_a812c05c:

    # MC @ think "This is all some of us have ever known."
    MC @ think "これが私たちの中には知り得たすべてです。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:359
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_0d3e6227:

    # MYU "Not seem fair."
    MYU "不公平だな。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:362
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_aff12971:

    # MYU "...Okay, Myu think on what you said."
    MYU "…よし、ミュ、お前の言ったことを考えるわ。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:363
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_e55b4a01:

    # MYU "But, if they {i}aren't{/i} responsible with money and power, is it not okay to punish them then?"
    MYU "しかし、彼らが金と権力を扱うのに{i}責任がない{/i}のなら、罰を与えてもいいのではないか？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:365
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_556bd6d7:

    # MYU "Mmm, won't people get hurt if you try get rid of them though?"
    MYU "うーん、でもそれ取り除こうとすると人が傷つくんじゃない？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:366
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_e624755c:

    # MYU "Myu would be sad to see people hurt."
    MYU "人々が傷つくのを見ると、ミュは悲しむだろう。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:367
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_f6a22ab9:

    # MYU "And more people might be upset if you DO get rid of them, so even more people get hurt then."
    MYU "仮にそれらを取り除いたとしても、不満を持つ人が増え、結果的にさらに多くの人が傷つくことになるかもしれません。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:368
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_607c1516:

    # MC @ smile "Very perceptive, Myu."
    MC @ smile "Myu、非常に観察力が鋭いですね。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:370
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_b82a42dc:

    # MYU "But, who put them in charge?"
    MYU "でも、彼らを任せたのは誰だ？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:371
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_989e19c4:

    # MYU "It sounds to Myu like they also {i}have{/i} more just for making choices for everyone else."
    MYU "ミュウには、彼らが他人のために選択をすることには、他にも{i}ある{/i}ような気がする。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:372
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_ee1c3eb6:

    # MYU "And, those choices seem to be more good for them than everyone."
    MYU "そして、その選択は、皆よりも彼らのためにより良く見える。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:373
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_a3f80df8:

    # MC @ smile "Heh, you're learning to speak and think way too fast for your own good sometimes, Myu."
    MC @ smile "へえ、時々やりすぎだよ、ミュ。話すことも考えることも覚えるのが早すぎるんだから。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:374
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_7368d55b:

    # MYU "... Myu do bad?"
    MYU "…ミュ、悪いことした？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:375
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_48449b6e:

    # MC @ smile "Not at all, Myu."
    MC @ smile "とんでもないよ、ミュちゃん。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:376
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_0d7cba86:

    # MC @ talk "Anyway, moving on..."
    MC @ talk "とにかく、先に進もう…"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:384
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_6dadeaea:

    # MC @ talk "This is where most normal students are taught."
    MC @ talk "ここが大半の普通の生徒が教えられる場所だ。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:385
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_7506ecb0:

    # MYU "Its so big!"
    MYU "でっかい!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:386
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_208990a5:

    # MC @ talk "Hundreds if not thousands are taught here every day."
    MC @ talk "毎日ここでは、何百人という、いや何千人という人々が教えられている。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:387
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_4667a551:

    # MYU "What do you learn?"
    MYU "何を学びますか？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:388
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_9f10a707:

    # MC @ smile "A lot actually, everything from basic defense to economics to about a hundred other things."
    MC @ smile "実際多くて、基本的な防衛から経済まで、百くらいの他のことについてもね。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:389
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_fe04ca43:

    # MC @ talk "The idea is they delegate you into a job best suited to your results during a festival we call the Terminus ceremony."
    MC @ talk "その考えとは、我々がターミナス儀式と呼ぶ祭りの間に、あなたの結果に最も適した仕事へと任命するというものです。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:390
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_0f714875:

    # MYU "What if you get a job you don't like?"
    MYU "もし好きじゃない仕事に就いたら？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:391
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_c971a6fc:

    # MC @ talk "Well, you're stuck with it."
    MC @ talk "しょうがないな。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:392
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_7a523241:

    # MC @ talk "At least, until this war is over."
    MC @ talk "せめて、この戦争が終わるまで。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:393
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_0d4f6c3b:

    # MC @ talk "But it doesn't always stay that way anyway, I mean, I was a scout, and now I'm officially employed by the Adventurers Guild."
    MC @ talk "でも、常にそういうわけじゃないし、だって私はスカウトだったけど、今は冒険者ギルドに正式採用されてるからね。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:394
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_2656b8c9:

    # MC @ talk "But those changes aren't the norm, more like, special circumstances."
    MC @ talk "しかし、そうした変化は通常ではなく、どちらかというと、特殊な事情によるものだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:395
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_d31503ba:

    # MYU "Myu see."
    MYU "ミュ see."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:396
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_7bd3d9dc:

    # MYU "Do all students learn together?"
    MYU "生徒全員が一緒に勉強するのですか？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:397
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_cc27e227:

    # MC @ talk "Mostly."
    MC @ talk "大体ね。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:398
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_f2f40a67:

    # MYU "{i}...Mostly?{/i}"
    MYU "{i}…たいてい？{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:399
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_f19c15dd:

    # MC @ talk "The rich students tend to have different teachers and some additional classes than most of us."
    MC @ talk "金持ちの生徒たちは、大抵の我々とは別の教師がつき、追加の授業を受ける傾向にある。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:400
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_d5c5fa1d:

    # MC @ talk "But other than that, yeah, we share lessons."
    MC @ talk "それ以外は、まあ、授業を一緒に受けてるね。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:401
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_dbf0e0be:

    # MYU "So, do rich students get jobs they don't like?"
    MYU "では、金持ちの学生は好きでもない仕事に就くのか？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:402
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_69419140:

    # MC @ think "Uhh, that doesn't really happen."
    MC @ think "あの…そういうことってあんまりないよ。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:403
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_092e4223_3:

    # MYU "...Why?"
    MYU "…どうして？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:404
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_b8e27f65:

    # MC @ talk "Because it's expected that those students will fill in for their parents when they're gone."
    MC @ talk "それは、彼らが親の代わりを担うことが期待されているからです。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:405
translate ja qst_HumanExp_6_cityTour_a5acadba:

    # MYU "But what if they're dumb?"
    MYU "でも、もし彼らがバカだったら？"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:406
