translate ja qst_HumanExp_11_returnFlowers_8f96e94b:

    # "As I stepped inside my home, I was greeted by the sudden sight of Myu sat patiently at the dinner table as [regina_ref!t] served her a plate of vegetables."
    "家に足を踏み入れると、突然、ミュウが夕食のテーブルに辛抱強く座っていて、[regina_ref!t]が彼女に野菜の皿を出している光景が目に入った。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:715
