    # "Taking the wild flower from my shaking hands, [regina_ref!t] poured the wild flower over Myu's food."
    "震える私の手から野生の花を受け取り、[regina_ref!t]はその野生の花をミュウの食事にかけた。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:719
translate ja qst_HumanExp_11_returnFlowers_9f775ce0:

    # "Myu began to devour the food with both hands quickly as [regina_ref!t] turned to face me, her calm smiling expression giving away her obvious displeasure of the situation."
    "ミュウが両手で素早く食事をむさぼり始める中、[regina_ref!t]が私に向き直った。彼女の穏やかな微笑みの表情が、この状況への明らかな不快感を露わにしていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/TheHumanExperience/scr.rpy:724
